bugs.body:
I exported my Refract data and was checking my tv shows and realized that many episodes and even entire seasons are missing from the export. They are marked correctly on the app but the data is missing from the export. I manually checked some of the recent ones, but I believe there are more missing, because the README.txt of the export says the episode list have 1 row per watched episode. The app episode counting says 9409 and the export shows only 9131 lines, so I understand there are 278 episodes missing on the export. 

Here are some examples of missing data that I found:
Sniper Butterfly: completed (30 episodes) on the app, is not shown at all on the export csv;
Our Sticky Love: completed (12 episodes) on the app, only episodes 1-3 are shown on the export csv;
Affinity: completed (40 episodes) on the app, is not shown at all on the export csv;
Road to Success: completed (32 episodes) on the app, only episodes 1-4, 6, 11-16 are shown on the export csv;

I'm sending my most recent export from the app and also a screenshot showing that the shows I listed above are marked as complete on the app.

[identity removed]
Device and OS version: iPhone 16 pro max, iOS 26.6
Refract app version: v1.6.716-embedded

